## 10. Process Stream Redirection and Error Handling

### Correct Operation

```bash
user@kalii:~\$ ps -eo pid,ppid,cmd,%cpu --sort=-%cpu 1> cpu_processes.log
user@kalii:~\$ head -n 4 cpu_processes.log
  PID  PPID CMD                         %CPU
 1245  1200 /usr/lib/firefox/firefox     4.2
  940   850 /usr/bin/Xorg                1.8
```

### Error Handling Demonstration

```bash
user@kalii:~\$ pxs -eo pid,ppid,cmd,%cpu --sort=-%cpu 1> cpu_processes.log
bash: pxs: command not found

user@kalii:~\$ cat cpu_processes.log

```
